  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The dish depends on a proper "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "yassa marinade",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "yassa-marinade"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " with a full 2 hours (or overnight) in the fridge. The "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "caramelised onions",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "caramelised-onions-yassa"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " need patience: use a wide pan and at least 40 minutes over medium heat."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Grill the chicken pieces before adding them to the sauce. The char from the grill adds flavour that the braising liquid alone cannot provide."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
